    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - A sand hockey match
        - Un match de hockey sur sable
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - 'In the year 2004 before Poseidon, Marline was enjoying her youth. She
          was traveling all around the sea, looking for new experiences.<br><br>But
          today, her goal was different: to watch the sand hockey finals. Her favorite
          team, the Tokyeau Sharks, were up against their eternal rivals, the Saint-Marin
          Otters. In no case did she want to miss this show. So, dressed with her
          best fan gear, she entered the first bar she saw on her path.'
        - "An 2004 avant Pos\xE9idon, Marline jouissait de sa jeunesse, elle voyageait
          partout dans l'oc\xE9an \xE0 la recherche de nouvelles exp\xE9riences.<br><br>Mais
          aujourd'hui son objectif \xE9tait tout autre : regarder la finale du match
          de hockey sur sable. Son \xE9quipe favorite les Tokyeau Sharks contre leurs
          rivaux \xE9ternels les Saint-Marin Otters. Elle ne voulait en aucun cas
          rater ce spectacle. Alors, v\xEAtue de son plus bel attirail de supporter,
          elle entra dans le premier bar qui croisa sa route.  "
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - The piracy degree
        - "Le dipl\xF4me de piraterie"
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - "- I'll give you one thing, this boat isn't a baby turtle without arms...<br>-
          It was a gift from my parents when I graduated from pirate school...<br>-
          Wow. What are we waiting for to get in? The Tokyeau Sharks are waiting
          for us!<br><br>They entered and made their way to the cockpit. Napol\xE9on
          successfully led his boat-pooler to his match.<br><br>- Thanks my little
          pirate. Come to the game with me, I'll buy you a drink."
        - "- Pour le coup, c\u2019est pas un bateau de b\xE9b\xE9 tortue sans bras\u2026<br>-
          C\u2019est un cadeau d\u2019mes parents qui date de l\u2019obtention de
          mon dipl\xF4me de piraterie\u2026<br>- Waouw. On attend quoi pour monter
          dedans ? Les Tokyeau Sharks nous attendent !<br><br>Ils entr\xE8rent et
          se dirig\xE8rent vers la cabine de pilotage. Napol\xE9on conduisit avec
          succ\xE8s sa co-batureuse jusqu\u2019\xE0 son match.<br><br>- Merci mon
          p\u2019tit pirate. Viens au match avec moi, j\u2019te paye une boisson."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Marline the leader
        - Marline la leadeuse
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - "Too impressed to refuse, the pirate followed the woman to the stadium.<br>Of
          course the fabulous Tokyeau Sharks won, Marline was crazy with joy and
          drank a few too many cocktails. She couldn't even stand straight enough
          to leave the stadium. Napol\xE9on helped her by taking her under his tentacles.<br><br>-
          You know, your tentacles are not so bad after all. I like them."
        - "Trop impressionn\xE9 pour refuser, le pirate suivit la femme jusqu\u2019au
          stade.<br>Bien-s\xFBr les fabuleux Tokyeau Sharks gagn\xE8rent, Marline
          folle de joie bu un peu trop de cocktails. Elle ne tenait m\xEAme plus
          debout pour sortir du stade. Napol\xE9on l\u2019aida en la prenant sous
          ses tentacules.<br><br>- T\u2019sais qu\u2019elles sont pas si mal tes
          tentacules finalement. Elles me plaisent bien."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Good night pirates
        - Bonne nuit les pirates
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - "Embarrassed by this unexpected statement, Napol\xE9on suddenly let go
          of the one he was helping to walk. Dying of laughter, she rolled on the
          floor and exclaimed:<br><br>- You may not be a good pirate Napolele, but
          you're a crazy enough octopus to stay with me. I like you, can I sleep
          in your boat tonight? I don't know where to go.<br><br>Napol\xE9on accepted
          without hesitation to welcome Marline in his boat. This woman, although
          original, had just declared her love for him. Perhaps tomorrow all this
          will no longer be, but tonight, he was living one of the best moments of
          his life."
        - "G\xEAn\xE9 par cette phrase inattendue, Napol\xE9on l\xE2cha d\u2019un
          seul coup celle qu\u2019il aidait \xE0 marcher. Morte de rire, elle se
          roula par terre et s\u2019exclama :<br><br>- T\u2019es ptetre pas un bon
          pirate Napol\xE9l\xE9, mais t\u2019es un poulpe assez fou pour rester avec
          moi. J't'aime bien, j\u2019peux dormir dans ton bateau cette nuit ? J\u2019sais
          pas o\xF9 aller.<br><br>Napol\xE9on accepta sans h\xE9siter d'accueillir
          Marline, cette femme, bien qu\u2019originale venait de lui d\xE9clarer
          son amour. Peut-\xEAtre que demain tout \xE7a n\u2019existera plus, mais
          ce soir, il vivait l\u2019un des meilleurs moments de sa vie."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - The quietest bar on the sea
        - "Le bar le plus calme de l'oc\xE9an"
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Proud and restless, she ordered a cocktail and sat in front of the television.
          But very soon noticed that the warm and feisty atmosphere so common to
          sand hockey matches was not there.<br>She found that only two customers
          were sitting in front of the television with her.<br>One was sleeping with
          a beer in his hand and the other was watching the program that was playing,
          some kind of general knowledge show called "Fish Tank". He was answering
          to the questions of the famous present Julien Leperche with such vigor
          that Marine couldn't help but being carried away by the spectacle.
        - "Fi\xE8re et impatiente, elle commanda un cocktail et s'installa devant
          la t\xE9l\xE9vision. Mais elle se rendit tr\xE8s vite compte que l'ambiance
          chaleureuse des matchs de hockey sur sable n'\xE9tait pas au rendez-vous.<br>Elle
          constata que seuls deux clients \xE9taient assis devant la t\xE9l\xE9vision
          avec elle.<br>L'un dormait sa bi\xE8re \xE0 la main et l'autre regardait
          le programme qui passait, une sorte d'\xE9mission de culture g\xE9n\xE9rale
          appel\xE9e \u201CQuestion pour un poisson\u201D. Il r\xE9pondait aux questions
          du c\xE9l\xE8bre pr\xE9sentateur Julien Laperche avec une telle vigueur
          que Marline se laissa emporter par ce spectacle."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Fish Tank
        - Question pour un poisson
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - This big octopus who looked like a pirate seemed fascinated by a program
          clearly aimed at people of the 5th age!<br>But suddenly, the feeling of
          the supporter hat on her head reminded her of the purpose of her visit.<br><br>-
          Oh, you old octopus, will you change the channel?<br>- In your dreams my
          good lady.<br><br>Marline's ears twitched. Not only did he deny her request
          but he also disrespected her. She climbed the table and changed the channel
          under the offended look of the octopus.
        - "Ce gros poulpe qui semblait \xEAtre un pirate \xE9tait fascin\xE9 par
          une \xE9mission pour le 5\xE8me \xE2ge !<br>Mais soudain, elle sentit son
          chapeau de supporter sur sa t\xEAte et se rappela du but de sa venue.<br><br>-
          Oh, vieux poulpe, tu veux bien changer de cha\xEEne ?<br>- Dans tes r\xEAves
          ma bonne dame.<br><br>Les oreilles de Marline fr\xE9mirent. Non seulement
          il avait refus\xE9 sa proposition mais en plus, il lui avait manqu\xE9
          de respect. Elle monta sur la table et changea de cha\xEEne sous le regard
          offusqu\xE9 du poulpe."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Wet behind the ears
        - Marline la poule d'eau
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - '- Who do you think your are? You''re still wet behind the ears!<br>- I
          think I am a Tokyeau Sharks fan, old man!<br>She lifted her hat and placed
          it on the octopus'' red skull.<br>- Watch it with with me, you''ll see
          it''s better than your nonsense.<br>Mad with rage and humiliated, the octopus
          grabbed the cocktail of the one who was bothering him to throw it at her.<br>-
          Get off my table!!<br>Marline avoided the projectile with such an ease
          that she could easily be mistaken for the main actress of an adventure
          film. She was, after all, used to it.'
        - "- Tu t'prends pour qui ma poule d\u2019eau ?<br>- Pour une fan des Tokyeau
          Sharks mon vieux !<br>Elle brandit son chapeau et le posa sur le cr\xE2ne
          rouge du poulpe.<br>- Regarde avec moi, tu vas voir c'est mieux que tes
          \xE2neries.<br>Fou de rage et humili\xE9, le poulpe attrapa le cocktail
          de celle qui le d\xE9rangeait pour lui lancer dessus.<br>- Barre toi d'ma
          table !!<br>Marline \xE9vita le projectile avec une facilit\xE9 digne de
          l\u2019actrice principale d\u2019un film d\u2019aventure, il faut dire
          qu'elle avait l'habitude."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Large tentacles
        - Grosses tentacules
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - You think you scare me with your big tentacles?<br>The supporter approached
          him and ran her finger over the many suction cups on the pirate's tentacle.<br><br>-
          Don't touch me!!<br><br>OH! What's going on here?<br><br>The bartender,
          taken aback by the argument of the two customers, walked towards them.
        - "Tu crois que tu m'fais peur avec tes grosses tentacules ?<br>La supporter
          s'approcha de lui et passa ses doigts sur les nombreuses ventouses pr\xE9sentes
          sur les tentacules du pirate.<br><br>- M'touche pas !!<br><br>- OH ! Qu\u2019est-ce
          qu\u2019il se passe ici ?<br><br>Le barman, interloqu\xE9 par la dispute
          des deux clients se dirigea vers eux."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Ocean Indiana Jones
        - Ocean Indiana Jones
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - I only wanted to watch the sand field hockey game and this freshwater pirate
          is stopping me!<br>- You'll see if I'm a freshwater pirate!<br>The octopus
          launched itself on Marline and tackled her to the ground. This would be
          it, would the very one he tackled  not practice multiple combat sports.
          She retaliated as quickly.<br>- GET OUT OF HERE! Go fight outside you savages!<br>The
          owner of the establishment kicked out the two fighters and they both found
          themselves at the door.<br>- You happy? None of us can watch the TV, now.
        - "Je voulais seulement regarder le match de hockey sur sable et ce pirate
          d\u2019eau douce m\u2019en emp\xEAche !<br>- Tu vas voir si j\u2019suis
          un pirate d\u2019eau douce.<br>Le poulpe se lan\xE7a sur Marline et la
          plaqua au sol, seulement, celle-ci pratiquait plus d\u2019un sport de combat,
          elle riposta aussi vite.<br>- SORTEZ D\u2019ICI ! Allez vous battre dehors
          bande de sauvages !<br>Le patron de l'\xE9tablissement sortit les deux
          combattants \xE0 coup de pied et ils se retrouv\xE8rent tous les deux \xE0
          la porte.<br>- T\u2019es contente ? Aucun d\u2019nous peut r\u2019garder
          la t\xE9l\xE9 maint\u2019nant."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - In the end a rugby match?
        - Finalement un match de rugby ?
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - '- Are you really a pirate? You fight like a baby turtle with no arms.<br>-
          Consarn! You''ll see if I''m not a pirate!<br>- Show me your boat then!
          If you take me to the ice hockey stadium before the game is over, I give
          you my respect.<br>Marline always knew how to turn situations in her favor,
          with this proposal she was almost sure to be able to attend her match.<br>-
          Follow me, I''ve got the most beautiful boat in the ocean.<br>On the way,
          the adventurer tried to find out more about her new driver.'
        - "- T\u2019es vraiment un pirate toi ? Tu te bats comme un b\xE9b\xE9 tortue
          sans bras.<br>- Vindiou ! Tu vas voir si j\u2019suis un pirate !<br>- Montre
          moi ton bateau alors ! Si tu m'emm\xE8nes au stade de hockey sur glace
          avant la fin du match, je te donne mon respect.<br>Marline savait toujours
          tourner les situations en sa faveur, avec cette proposition elle \xE9tait
          pratiquement s\xFBre de pouvoir assister \xE0 son match.<br>- Suis-moi,
          j\u2019ai l\u2019plus beau rafiot d\u2019l\u2019oc\xE9an.<br>Sur le chemin,
          l\u2019aventuri\xE8re chercha \xE0 en savoir plus sur son d\xE9sormais
          conducteur."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Who are you anyway?
        - T'es qui toi au fait ?
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - "- So what's your name?<br>- Napol\xE9on.<br>- Ahaha, finally a quality.
          It's a beautiful name.<br>- Hm.<br>The pirate was not very talkative, it
          must be said that he felt overwhelmed by the invasive charisma of this
          fish like no other. Said person now walked proudly while humming a joyful
          tune. She had beaten him by far during their altercation and now she wanted
          to get into his boat. She had managed to manipulate him without him even
          suspecting it. This woman was really impressive."
        - "- Tu t\u2019appelles comment toi ?<br>- Napol\xE9on.<br>- Ahaha, enfin
          une qualit\xE9. C\u2019est un beau pr\xE9nom.<br>- Hum.<br>Le pirate n\u2019\xE9tait
          pas tr\xE8s bavard, il faut dire qu\u2019il se sentait \xE9cras\xE9 face
          au charisme envahissant de ce poisson pas comme les autres. Celle-ci marchait
          fi\xE8rement en chantonnant un air joyeux, elle l\u2019avait largement
          battu lors de leur altercation et maintenant elle voulait monter dans son
          bateau. Elle avait r\xE9ussi \xE0 le manipuler sans m\xEAme qu\u2019il
          s\u2019en doute. Cette femme \xE9tait vraiment impressionnante."
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - Marline the adventurer
        - "Marline l'aventuri\xE8re"
    - Category: Collectible
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - '- I am Marline, adventurer from father to daughter! I have already crossed
          the ocean three times! And you, do you walk around a lot?<br>- No...I''m
          in a pirate group, but they never call me to go on missions.<br>- Ahaha,
          you must be really bad. It''s pathetic.<br>- I prefer pottery to piracy...<br><br>An
          interesting information seemed to come out of this octopus at last, but
          before the adventurer could say anything, they reached the ship. In front
          of them was a large, brand new frigate.'
        - "- Moi je suis Marline, aventuri\xE8re de p\xE8re en fille ! J\u2019ai
          d\xE9j\xE0 travers\xE9 l\u2019oc\xE9an trois fois ! Et toi, tu te balade
          beaucoup ?<br>- Non\u2026j\u2019suis dans un groupe de pirates, mais ils
          m\u2019appellent jamais pour partir en mission.<br>- Ahaha, tu dois \xEAtre
          vraiment mauvais. C\u2019est lamentable.<br>- J\u2019pref\xE8re la poterie
          \xE0 la piraterie\u2026<br><br>Une partie int\xE9ressante semblait enfin
          se d\xE9gager de ce poulpe, mais avant que l\u2019aventuri\xE8re ne puisse
          r\xE9pondre quoi que ce soit, ils atteignirent le bateau. Devant eux, se
          pr\xE9sentait une grande fr\xE9gate flambant neuve. "
